The attribute which sorts the articles in tables according to the definition in the 'Sort articles by' attribute.
]EN_ATTR_COMMENT]

[DE_ATTR_COMMENT[
Gibt die Art des Artikels an (NL).
]DE_ATTR_COMMENT]
[EN_ATTR_COMMENT[
Indicates the type of article (NL).
]EN_ATTR_COMMENT]

[DE_ATTR_COMMENT[
